# GORM

Follow `docs/architecture/persistence.md` and ADR-0003.

- SQLite via `gorm.io/gorm` and `gorm.io/driver/sqlite` only.
- Schema via `AutoMigrate` on a known model list.
- MUST NOT return `*gorm.DB`.
- MUST NOT import GORM from domain or application.
- MUST NOT store passwords in SQLite.
- MUST NOT put business rules in GORM hooks.
- MUST NOT add goose or golang-migrate.
